        "blocks": [
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-001",
            "text": "# 教师差旅/学术交流资助申请 测试材料规则来源",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 0
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-002",
            "text": "**范围声明：**本文件用于隔离的合成流程测试，不是正式校规、申报通知、财务审批或法律意见。所有测试身份、编号和金额均虚构。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 1
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-003",
            "text": "## 公开来源与适用边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 2
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-004",
            "text": "### 成都理工大学财务处2025年差旅费报销标准检索页",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 3
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-005",
            "text": "- 来源：https://jcc.cdut.edu.cn/ssjg.jsp?currentnum=6&newskeycode2=&searchScope=0&wbtreeid=1033",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 4
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-006",
            "text": "- 适用范围：页面列出2025年国内差旅费（成理校发〔2025〕33号）和科研差旅费标准链接；实际标准须按人员类别、目的地、日期、资金来源和审批记录核对。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 5
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-007",
            "text": "### 成都理工大学科研经费报销流程（财务处）",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 6
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-008",
            "text": "- 来源：https://jcc.cdut.edu.cn/__local/D/23/C5/05E72CFA4532D2A2946EBEBE258_FFC48E39_8EEE3.pdf",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 7
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-009",
            "text": "- 适用范围：科研经费报销材料及流程，所列依据包括科研差旅办法与2024年经费管理实施办法；不覆盖所有费用类型。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 8
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-010",
            "text": "## 本次审核的规则边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 9
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-011",
            "text": "公开差旅报销标准不等于差旅资助申请规则。事前资助要有本年度资助通知、岗位类别与可用额度。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 10
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-012",
            "text": "## 测试要求",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 11
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-013",
            "text": "- 只把来源文件中明确写出的内容当作外部规则。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 12
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-014",
            "text": "- 缺少校内当年通知、审批、积分映射、授权签字或有效性确认时，标记待确认，不要猜测。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 13
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-015",
            "text": "- 证据需要引用案卷中的具体材料与可定位位置。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 14
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muyj76w9-v1-block-016",
            "text": "- 本文件并非本次模拟数据的答案。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 15
            },
            "kind": "text"
          }
        ],
